{"data":[{"type":"search_result","highlight":{"description":"以前我也是<em>Kotlin</em>信徒，直到现在我也觉得Kotlin在语言上可圈可点。 但Jvm系的基础设施开发体验真的是稀烂","title":"如何评价<em>kotlin</em>？"},"object":{"id":"1936787046304842491","type":"answer","excerpt":"以前我也是<em>Kotlin</em>信徒，直到现在我也觉得Kotlin在语言上可圈可点。 但Jvm系的基础设施开发体验真的是稀烂","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/answers/1936787046304842491","voteup_count":101,"comment_count":71,"favorites_count":42,"created_time":1754546015,"updated_time":1754560634,"content":"<p data-pid=\"LYe6bxYE\">以前我也是Kotlin信徒，直到现在我也觉得Kotlin在语言上可圈可点。</p><p data-pid=\"6e1vbR2W\">但Jvm系的基础设施开发体验真的是稀烂，尤其是整个Maven/Gradle体系。</p><p data-pid=\"ZuszR6c7\">卡、慢、臃肿无处不在。开项目、构建、启动，简直像在屎坑里打滚。</p><p data-pid=\"bHOxRKr4\">举个例子，.Net的Roslyn的代码生成是实时的，不断的检查代码变动，MSBuild会随时生成代码。</p><p data-pid=\"7NsUwLvi\">你能想象出，Kotlin每写一行代码，Gradle就重新Build一遍的样子吗？</p><p data-pid=\"xF05p1AV\">另外就是涉及到Native方面，无论是AOT还是JNI，你就用吧，一用一个不吱声。</p><p data-pid=\"iG7VZFV6\">Jvm体系根本就不是通用的解决方案，他只能在Web和Android撒欢。</p><p data-pid=\"MOnRAmi4\">Kotlin只能自己搓一个Kotlin Multiplatform，想突破限制，但做了几年也没什么成效。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"yCOyOsbm\">但如果你问我最喜欢的语言，我仍然会答Kotlin。</p><p data-pid=\"7721-ZOK\">尤其是玩Compose的时候，被mvvm强暴了多少年的大脑，都感到了一丝通透。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span class=\"n\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nf\">MessageCard</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">Message</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">Row</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">Image</span><span class=\"p\">(</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">painter</span> <span class=\"p\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">painterResource</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">drawable</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">profile_picture</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">contentDescription</span> <span class=\"p\">=</span> <span class=\"s\">&#34;Contact profile picture&#34;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">)</span>\n    \n       <span class=\"n\">Column</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">Text</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">text</span> <span class=\"p\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">author</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">Text</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">text</span> <span class=\"p\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">msg</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">body</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">@Composable</span>\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nf\">Conversation</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">messages</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"p\">&lt;</span><span class=\"n\">Message</span><span class=\"p\">&gt;)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">LazyColumn</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">items</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">messages</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"n\">message</span> <span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span>\n            <span class=\"n\">MessageCard</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">message</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span></pre></div><p data-pid=\"8cg0GPkp\">C#再进化十年也学不来的。</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"VNL-E90J\">评论区有些朋友不了解Kotlin的DSL，误以为Kotlin的Lambda只是省了几个括号。</p><p data-pid=\"zVOnIun2\">实际上Kotlin的Lambda包含了隐含this作用域，隐含it参数等重要内容。这两个让Kotlin的Lambda有了质的差距。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nf\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">scope</span><span class=\"p\">:</span> <span class=\"n\">ListScope</span><span class=\"p\">.()</span> <span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span> <span class=\"nc\">ListScope</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">fun</span> <span class=\"nf\">ListScope</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Item</span><span class=\"p\">(){</span> <span class=\"p\">}</span></pre></div><p data-pid=\"AMLUdDzq\">上述代码中，Item只允许在List的作用域内使用，无法在外部使用。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span class=\"n\">List</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">Item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span></pre></div><p data-pid=\"zFn1Y7iR\">如果使用其他语言，就无法省略this作用域。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span class=\"n\">List</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span> \n   <span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Item</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n</pre></div><p data-pid=\"SUEbCDqJ\">这种情况下，两者的代码量差距就明显了，如果是多层嵌套：</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span class=\"n\">A</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">B</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">C</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n            \n        <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"n\">D</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">E</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n            \n        <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span></pre></div><p data-pid=\"VntnfBx3\">换做其他语言如C#就会变得臃肿无比。</p><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span class=\"n\">A</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s1</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">s1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">B</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s2</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">s2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">C</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s3</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n           \n        <span class=\"p\">});</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">});</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">s1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">D</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s2</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">s2</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">E</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s3</span> <span class=\"p\">=&gt;</span> <span class=\"p\">{</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"p\">});</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">});</span>\n<span class=\"p\">});</span>\n</pre></div><p data-pid=\"xQKTSL93\">实际上Kotlin的Lambda设计的并不是很好，有些情况下需要打补丁。但奈何他的体验是独一份的，找不到更好的代餐。</p>","thumbnail_info":{"count":0,"thumbnails":[],"type":"thumbnail_info","total_count":0},"relationship":{"voting":1,"is_author":false,"is_thanked":false,"is_nothelp":false,"following_upvoter":[],"following_upvoter_count":0,"following_collect":[],"following_collect_count":0,"high_level_creator":[],"high_level_creator_count":0,"is_following":false},"question":{"id":"1924054028658116132","type":"question","name":"如何评价<em>kotlin</em>？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1924054028658116132","answer_count":0,"follow_count":0,"attached_info_bytes":""},"author":{"id":"redacted-author-id","url_token":"redacted-author-token","name":"脱敏作者","headline":"脱敏简介","gender":-1,"is_followed":false,"is_following":false,"user_type":"people","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/people/redacted-author-id","type":"people","avatar_url":"https://pic.example/redacted-avatar.jpg","badge":[],"authority_info":null,"voteup_count":3980,"follower_count":552,"badge_v2":{"title":"","merged_badges":[],"detail_badges":[],"icon":"","night_icon":""},"badge_v2_string":"{\"title\":\"\",\"merged_badges\":[],\"detail_badges\":null,\"icon\":\"\",\"night_icon\":\"\"}","topic_bayes_map":null,"topic_map":{},"verify_bayes":"","avatar_url_template":"https://pic.example/redacted-avatar-{size}.jpg"},"is_anonymous":false,"is_zhi_plus":false,"is_zhi_plus_content":false,"extra":"","health_tag":"","answer_type":"normal","sub_content_type":"","settings":{"table_of_contents":{"enabled":false}},"attached_info_bytes":"","biz_encoded_params":"sw%3DKotlin","answer_count":13,"visits_count":54383,"description":"","title":"如何评价kotlin？","native":0},"hit_labels":null,"index":1}],"paging":{"is_end":true}}
